{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_41_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_41","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，王三月，紀叔姬歸於酅。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_41_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_41","textTraditional":"國而曰歸，此邑也，其曰歸何也？吾女也。失國喜得其所，故言歸焉爾。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_41_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_41","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_41_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_41","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，甲午，宋萬弒其君捷，及其大夫仇牧。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_41_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_41","textTraditional":"宋萬，宋之卑者也，卑者以國氏。以尊及卑也。仇牧，閑也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_41_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_41","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月，宋萬出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}